<http://data.silknow.org/object/0007bc1d-e3fb-3940-a97c-f4cd78ae5fcf>
        a                              ecrm:E22_Man-Made_Object ;
        rdfs:comment                   "Brocade is a rich silk fabric with patterns in gold and silver thread.  This piece has pattern of an ornamented trellis enclosing conventional flower in gold on a cream silk ground."@en , "Silk brocade textile, Varanasi, 19th Century."@en ;
